{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"diagnosis\":\"The original proof repeatedly builds existential witnesses and nested conjunctions with tactic-level `exists`/`constructor`. Replacing those blocks with direct dependent tuples and consistently destructuring the bisimilarity witness yields a smaller, more deterministic proof with less elaboration work.\",\"proof_body\":\"by\\n  intro h\\n  use @ChoiceBisim _ _ defs, ChoiceBisim.choice h\\n  intro s1 s2 hr μ\\n  constructor\\n  · intro s1' ht\\n    cases hr with\\n    | choice hbisim =>\\n      obtain ⟨rel, hrel, hb⟩ := hbisim\\n      cases ht with\\n      | choiceL ht =>\\n        obtain ⟨s2', ht', hrel'⟩ := hb.follow_fst hrel ht\\n        exact ⟨s2', Tr.choiceL ht',\\n          ChoiceBisim.bisim (hb.le_bisimilarity _ _ hrel')⟩\\n      | choiceR ht =>\\n        exact ⟨s1', Tr.choiceR ht,\\n          ChoiceBisim.bisim HomBisimilarity.refl⟩\\n    | bisim hbisim =>\\n      obtain ⟨rel, hrel, hb⟩ := hbisim\\n      obtain ⟨s2', ht', hrel'⟩ := hb.follow_fst hrel ht\\n      exact ⟨s2', ht', ChoiceBisim.bisim\\n        (hb.le_bisimilarity _ _ hrel')⟩\\n  · intro s2' ht\\n    cases hr with\\n    | choice hbisim =>\\n      obtain ⟨rel, hrel, hb⟩ := hbisim\\n      cases ht with\\n      | choiceL ht =>\\n        obtain ⟨s1', ht', hrel'⟩ := hb.follow_snd hrel ht\\n        exact ⟨s1', Tr.choiceL ht',\\n          ChoiceBisim.bisim (hb.le_bisimilarity _ _ hrel')⟩\\n      | choiceR ht =>\\n        exact ⟨s2', Tr.choiceR ht,\\n          ChoiceBisim.bisim HomBisimilarity.refl⟩\\n    | bisim hbisim =>\\n      obtain ⟨rel, hrel, hb⟩ := hbisim\\n      obtain ⟨s1', ht', hrel'⟩ := hb.follow_snd hrel ht\\n      exact ⟨s1', ht', ChoiceBisim.bisim\\n        (hb.le_bisimilarity _ _ hrel')⟩\"}"}}
